## 18. BUDGET VS. ACTUAL

Compare the approved budget against actual posted supplier invoice costs.

Display:

- Approved Budget.
- Cost Incurred.
- Cost Committed (open).
- Combined committed and incurred position.
- Variance.

Use the proposed calculation:

Variance = Approved Budget − (Cost Incurred + Cost Committed).

